<section class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 py-16">
  <div class="text-center mb-12">
    <h1 class="font-display text-4xl md:text-5xl font-bold text-farm-green">Our Story</h1>
  </div>

  <div class="prose prose-lg prose-stone max-w-none">
    <p>
      We started with a simple dream: to create a place where families could slow
      down, reconnect with nature, and experience the joy of farm life. What began
      as a few acres and a handful of animals has grown into a beloved destination
      for visitors from near and far.
    </p>

    <p>
      Today, our farm is home to a herd of curious alpacas, playful Nigerian dwarf
      goats, and a flock of friendly ducks. In the summer, our blueberry fields
      open for pick-your-own, and when fall rolls around, the pumpkin patch
      becomes the heart of the farm.
    </p>

    <p>
      We also offer overnight stays through
      <a href="<%= site.metadata.booking_url %>" target="_blank" rel="noopener">HearthHost</a> —
      cozy cabins for those who want comfort and charm, and campsites for those
      who prefer sleeping under the stars. Either way, you'll wake up to
      fresh country air and the sounds of the farm.
    </p>

    <h2>Visit Us</h2>

    <p>
      We're located at <strong><%= site.metadata.address %></strong>.
      Day visits are welcome during open hours — no appointment needed.
      For group bookings, school trips, or private events, please reach
      out in advance.
    </p>

    <p>
      <strong>Phone:</strong> <a href="tel:<%= site.metadata.phone %>"><%= site.metadata.phone %></a><br/>
      <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:<%= site.metadata.email %>"><%= site.metadata.email %></a>
    </p>
  </div>
